        "quote": "Plaintiff alleges that she slipped and fell on grapes that had fallen to the floor in the produce aisle of defendant's supermarket and that the floor in the market was frequently littered with produce.",
        "statement_status": "allegation"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "While defendant showed that it did not create or have actual notice of loose grapes in the produce aisle at the time of plaintiff's accident, defendant failed to submit sufficient evidence to show, as a matter of law, that it lacked constructive notice of the condition.",
